Try passing a ramdisk_size boot parameter to the kernel. Something like
ramdisk_size=3D20480.

I've put in a fix for this in debian-cd, since it seems to have just
gone over the 16 mb size limit, I increased it to 20 mb. That change
will appear in the next daily build.

